<title>USA: Pinnacle Micro VP and founder steps down.</title>
<headline>Pinnacle Micro VP and founder steps down.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pinnacle Micro Inc Tuesday said Scott Blum, vice president of marketing and co-founder of the company, is leaving the company effective today.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said he will remain as a director.</p>
</text>
